{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321420001:1":{"text":"哥哥，你……你又受伤了！","source_cn":"哥哥，你……你又受伤了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CCB1E11081BF6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321420002:1":{"text":"行了，又不是什么很严重的伤。小小年纪，不要总是替我操心。","source_cn":"行了，又不是什么很严重的伤。小小年纪，不要总是替我操心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC76D33D21C94560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321420003:1":{"text":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","source_cn":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5518BBAC601B05FE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","female":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","variant_male_record_index":"148773","variant_female_record_index":"148774","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321420003":{"text":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","source_cn":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5518BBAC601B05FE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","female":"其实你们不用帮我的……不过，还是谢谢你们。","variant_male_record_index":"148773","variant_female_record_index":"148774","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321420004:1":{"text":"就是说啊。我们去帮你采花，你却到处乱跑！","source_cn":"就是说啊。我们去帮你采花，你却到处乱跑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1934300F0DFEBBCD","variant_status":"","male":""